Ported from an internal auth implementation (ai_member_cloud) to a
provider-agnostic library: the ORM was replaced with a raw-SQL executor and all
configuration was made injectable. The security design — argon2id password
hashing, enumeration-safe account flows, server-side revocable sessions — is
preserved from that implementation.
